{"para_id": 38, "raw": "{\n  \"triples\": [\n    {\n      \"subject\": \"definition\",\n      \"predicate\": \"uses\",\n      \"object\": \"string precedence predicate\",\n      \"object_type\": \"Concept\",\n      \"source_sentence\": \"One caveat is that in the definition for the AR successor order, ϕ2,2 ⊳′ (x, y), ϕ2,3 ⊳′ (x, y), ϕ3,2 ⊳′ (x, y), and ϕ3,3 ⊳′ (x, y) all used the string precedence predicate x ≺y, either directly in the definition or through the use of the predicate span(x, y).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"subject\": \"definition\",\n      \"predicate\": \"uses\",\n      \"object\": \"predicate span(x, y)\",\n      \"object_type\": \"Concept\",\n      \"source_sentence\": \"One caveat is that in the definition for the AR successor order, ϕ2,2 ⊳′ (x, y), ϕ2,3 ⊳′ (x, y), ϕ3,2 ⊳′ (x, y), and ϕ3,3 ⊳′ (x, y) all used the string precedence predicate x ≺y, either directly in the definition or through the use of the predicate span(x, y).\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "n_tokens": 817, "truncated": false}
